     "url": "https://www.npr.org/2026/10/11/nx-s1-5996550/politics-chat-trump-announces-fuel-deal-with-russia-what-does-it-mean-for-sanctions",
     "text": "LIASSON: Well, one thing he's doing is struggling, without much success, to bring down diesel and gas prices. He's tried a lot of things. The latest now is removing sanctions on Russia, even though, as you just said, that might not make much of a difference in prices. Then the sanctions that Trump signed off on less than a month ago targeting Russia's energy revenues, which helped Russia fund its war against Ukraine - now the U.S. is going to be adding to those revenues. And Congress, with big bipartisan support, passed a law just a couple of days before that giving Trump expanded tariff powe…",
     "title": "Politics chat: Trump announces fuel deal with Russia. What does it mean for sanctions?",
     "publishedAt": "2026-10-11T12:03:56.000Z",
     "fetchedAt": "2026-10-12T01:51:59.650Z",
     "version": 478,
     "publishedAfterPost": false,
